<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut its rating on Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Circus Circus was off 3/8 to 33-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
